    {
      "key": "The agent first works out, with you, what “done” means as a short list of checks the app can run itself: tests that pass, a number that reaches a target, a sentence a reviewer finds true. Then it works round after round, and after each one the app runs the checks, keeps the round when things got closer and undoes it when not. It stops when every check holds, or at a limit.",
